Save to cloud. Until then, share links would move workouts between devices with no server: compress a workout with
CompressionStream, base64url it into `#import/<data>`, and the user sends the link to themselves (AirDrop, Messages).

# Ideas for the future

Beeps can be slow when background as requestAnimationFrame does not run and setInterval is throttled in the background. This can be resolved in a few ways:

- Future: schedule beeps ahead with Web Audio (audio clock keeps running when hidden)
- Future: iOS - canvas.captureStream() video in picture-in-picture to keep a timer + sound going outside Safari
- Future: AirPlay to Apple TV needs a real media URL (e.g. HLS); screen mirroring works today with no changes

We might consider the video methods as a feature-add, so that users can stream to TV.
